{"parse":{"title":"特性/冰原裂齿猪王","pageid":7352,"revid":17902,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E5%86%B0%E5%8E%9F%E8%A3%82%E9%BD%BF%E7%8C%AA%E7%8E%8B&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E5%86%B0%E5%8E%9F%E8%A3%82%E9%BD%BF%E7%8C%AA%E7%8E%8B&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E5%86%B0%E5%8E%9F%E8%A3%82%E9%BD%BF%E7%8C%AA%E7%8E%8B&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>冰原裂齿猪王</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".27\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"'\">'<b><i></i></b></span><b><i><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></i></b></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">特性详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\"><img alt=\"特性 冰原裂齿猪王.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/20/kekmlp124treql2j5qc8uq8quk0wbbr.png/80px-%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7_%E5%86%B0%E5%8E%9F%E8%A3%82%E9%BD%BF%E7%8C%AA%E7%8E%8B.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/20/kekmlp124treql2j5qc8uq8quk0wbbr.png/120px-%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7_%E5%86%B0%E5%8E%9F%E8%A3%82%E9%BD%BF%E7%8C%AA%E7%8E%8B.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/2/20/kekmlp124treql2j5qc8uq8quk0wbbr.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:55%;\">\n<p>拥有特殊光环，效果：自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">4</font>格内所有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">冰原裂齿猪</span>]击退敌人时，若敌人触发碰撞，则目标受到[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冰封\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">冰封</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。<br />✦受到非[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">背击</span>]攻击时，最终伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">40%</font>，并获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"再行动\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">再行动</font></span></span>]。<br />✦被攻击时，若生命值低于<font color=\"#ed7950\">70%</font>，受到[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"守护失效\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">守护失效</font></span></span>]。<br />✦攻击后，可再移动<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格。<br />拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"自然守护\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">自然守护</font></span></span>]，效果：<br />✦最终受到伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">40%</font>。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:25%;\" rowspan=\"1\"><b>该特性属于</b><br /><div class=\"hero_box\">\n<div class=\"hero_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E9%AD%94%E7%89%A9%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%86%B0%E5%8E%9F%E8%A3%82%E9%BD%BF%E7%8C%AA%E7%8E%8B\" title=\"魔物图鉴库/冰原裂齿猪王\"><img alt=\"冰原裂齿猪王 像素模型.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/59/4niqz03545ws0bhd0nf8zluuckz7d9a.png/75px-%E5%86%B0%E5%8E%9F%E8%A3%82%E9%BD%BF%E7%8C%AA%E7%8E%8B_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/59/4niqz03545ws0bhd0nf8zluuckz7d9a.png/113px-%E5%86%B0%E5%8E%9F%E8%A3%82%E9%BD%BF%E7%8C%AA%E7%8E%8B_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/5/59/4niqz03545ws0bhd0nf8zluuckz7d9a.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></a></div>\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022164203\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.076 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.112 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 654/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 12437/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3374/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 13/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   94.855      1 模板:特性\n100.00%   94.855      1 -total\n 62.60%   59.380      1 模板:中括号介绍化\n 56.96%   54.030      6 模板:中括号介绍\n 11.97%   11.357      1 模板:面包屑\n  5.48%    5.199      1 模板:魔物图\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:7352-0!dateformat=default and timestamp 20261022164203 and revision id 17902. Serialized with PHP.\n -->\n</div>","categories":[{"sortkey":"","category":"特性","missing":true}],"images":["特性_冰原裂齿猪王.png","冰原裂齿猪王_像素模型.png"],"sections":[{"toclevel":1,"level":"2","line":"'<b><i>","number":"1","index":"T-1","fromtitle":"模板:特性","byteoffset":null,"anchor":"'"}],"displaytitle":"特性/冰原裂齿猪王","wikitext":"{{特性\n|魔物名称=冰原裂齿猪王\n|特性名称=\n|特性图标=冰原裂齿猪王\n|特性描述=拥有特殊光环，效果：自身范围<font color=#ed7950>4</font>格内所有[冰原裂齿猪]击退敌人时，若敌人触发碰撞，则目标受到[<font color=#f3c156>冰封</font>]，持续<font color=#ed7950>2</font>回合。